# Clutch local dev overrides — copy to .env and fill in.  Never commit real values.
#
# Infisical is the sole source of truth for app settings (see INFISICAL.md).
# These process-env overrides are for local dev and offline work only:
# explicitly-set env vars always win over Infisical values (local override),
# and with no INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID/SECRET present the app seeds its settings
# cache from these instead (loud warning on stderr).

# --- Infisical access (machine secret store in production; .env only for dev) ---
# INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID=
# INFISICAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
# CLUTCH_INFISICAL_ENV=dev   # dev | staging | prod (default: prod)

# --- Secrets (placeholders — real values live in Infisical, never here) ---
# MINIMAX_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# META_API_KEY=

# --- MiniMax config ---
# CLUTCH_MINIMAX_API_KEY_NAME=MINIMAX_API_KEY
# CLUTCH_MINIMAX_BASE_URL=https://api.minimax.io/v1
# CLUTCH_MINIMAX_MODEL=MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed
# CLUTCH_MINIMAX_PROFILE=minimax-headless

# --- Web / tailnet ---
# CLUTCH_WEB_HOST=127.0.0.1
# CLUTCH_WEB_PORT=3180
# CLUTCH_TAILNET_HOST=
# CLUTCH_TAILNET_IPV4=
# CLUTCH_TRUSTED_HOSTS=

# --- Knobs ---
# CLUTCH_SETTINGS_REFRESH_MS=300000
